          "fresh_running_jump_24": "Execute exactly: 1 native frames holding {'horizontal': 'right', 'vertical': 'released', 'jump': 'released', 'run': 'held'} then 24 native frames holding {'horizontal': 'right', 'vertical': 'released', 'jump': 'held', 'run': 'held'}. One fresh A press after a1-frame release. Can initiate a jump only from a solid surface; never resets A on later landing. Hold duration is fixed, even after a ceiling bump or landing, and can carry Mario forward until the entire sequence ends.",
          "fresh_walking_jump_24": "Execute exactly: 1 native frames holding {'horizontal': 'right', 'vertical': 'released', 'jump': 'released', 'run': 'released'} then 24 native frames holding {'horizontal': 'right', 'vertical': 'released', 'jump': 'held', 'run': 'released'}. One fresh A press after a1-frame release. Can initiate a jump only from a solid surface; never resets A on later landing. Hold duration is fixed, even after a ceiling bump or landing, and can carry Mario forward until the entire sequence ends.",
