        "instructions": "Choose one fixed declared controller sequence for safe forward progress. Use pixels to plan travel during the entire sequence, including any landing and continued movement before the next observation. Choose takeoff near a visible gap edge so the jump lasts until safe far ground. All choices are yours; no sensor-based correction or automatic jump exists.",
