    "initial_provider_text": [
      "{\"game\":\"Super Mario Bros 1-1\",\"instructions\":\"Play Mario1-1 alive to the flag at the right, using actual screenshots only. CURRENT image is FIRST; PAST image if present is motion context. Physics is paused while deciding. Right moves, B runs faster/farther, A starts a jump only from a solid surface on a new press. Hold A through ascent for height and airtime; releasing too early makes a low short hop. Holding A through landing cannot start another jump. Enemy side contact hurts and landing atop stomps. Solid blocks/ceilings can interrupt ascent; solid pipes/stairs support Mario, background hills/clouds do not. Plan landing on visible ground, take off for gaps near their edge, avoid unnecessary hopping on clear flat ground. Your chosen fixed sequence executes exactly, even if landing happens before the sequence ends. No actions check contact, detect hazards, or correct your choice.\",\"next_control_interval_native_frames\":\"Chosen fixed sequence duration, see action choices.\",\"previous_controls\":[]}",
